# Server-only. Never use a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix or commit your real key.
# Create a key at https://console.groq.com/keys and keep the account on the Free plan.
# Quota exhaustion returns an error. The app never falls back to OpenAI or another provider.
GROQ_API_KEY=
# Optional: additional trusted origins, comma-separated. Same-origin is allowed.
ASSISTANT_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
